- Made from genuine waxed leather for long-lasting durability

- Stylish retro design with a classic brown finish

- Adjustable shoulder strap and top handles for versatile carrying

- Durable metal hardware and secure buckles

- Ideal for daily use, office, or special occasions

- New arrival with best price in Pakistan for premium quality

· Type: Bag · Material: Leather · Style: Retro · Gender: Women. · Product Code: MZCHYHAM7007', 'This elegant retro handbag is crafted from genuine waxed leather, offering both style and lasting durability.', 3078, NULL, NULL, 'cat-bags-accessories', 'Ruby''s Select', 25, 0, 1, '👜', 'https://www.markaz.app/api/export/image/1257-37-657409-product-1.webp?src=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.markaz.app%2Fpakistan%2Fproducts%2F1257-37-657409-product-1.webp', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'Waxed Leather Retro Boston Bag for Women | Ruby''s.pk', 'This elegant retro handbag is crafted from genuine waxed leather, offering both style and lasting durability.', datetime('now')),
