('p-ba-20', 'Silver Rhinestone Clutch for Weddings & Parties', 'silver-rhinestone-clutch-for-weddings-parties', 'MKZ-637421', 'This elegant evening clutch is perfect for Pakistani bridesmaids, wedding guests, or any formal event where you want to shine. Its sleek silver design with sparkling rhinestones and durable aluminum beadwork ensures it stays stylish even after repeated use. Whether you’re attending a gala, engagement party, or a high-society dinner, this bag adds glamour without compromising on comfort.

Crafted with premium quality materials, this clutch is built to last. The aluminum sheet base provides sturdy support, while the intricate beadwork and rhinestone embellishments catch the light beautifully. The chain strap is both fashionable and functional, allowing you to carry it over your shoulder or hold it in your hand. Its compact size makes it ideal for carrying essentials like your phone, lipstick, and keys without weighing you down.

- Durable aluminum construction for long-lasting use

- Sparkling rhinestone and beadwork for a glamorous look

- Adjustable chain strap for versatile wear

- Perfect size for evening events and parties

- Premium quality materials at the best price in Pakistan

- New arrival, ideal for weddings and social gatherings

· Type: Bag · Perfect for carrying essentials. · Product Code: MZCHYHA420', 'This elegant evening clutch is perfect for Pakistani bridesmaids, wedding guests, or any formal event where you want to shine.', 2450, NULL, NULL, 'cat-bags-accessories', 'Ruby''s Select', 25, 0, 1, '👜', 'https://www.markaz.app/api/export/image/pakistan_637421.png?src=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.markaz.app%2FGenerativeMedia%2FPakistan%2Fimages%2Fpakistan_637421.png', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'Silver Rhinestone Clutch for Weddings & Parties | Ruby''s.pk', 'This elegant evening clutch is perfect for Pakistani bridesmaids, wedding guests, or any formal event where you want to shine.', datetime('now'));

